{"id":"H2241","lemma":"זֵתָם","transliteration":"zetam","sayIt":"ze-TAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zetham","meaning":"A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.23.8;\nson of Libni (H3845G) ;\nbrother of: Joel (H3100O) and Jehiel (H3171H)\n§ Zetham = \"olive\"\na Gershonite Levite, the son of Jehieli and grandson of Laadan","glosses":["zetham"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-23","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zetham","kjv":"and Zetham"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Zetham","kjv":"Zetham"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 23:8","note":"The sons of Ladan: Jehiel the chief, Zetham, and Joel, three.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H3845","lemma":"לִבְנִי","transliteration":"livni","gloss":"Libni"},{"id":"H3100","lemma":"יוֹאֵל","transliteration":"yoel","gloss":"Joel"},{"id":"H3171","lemma":"יְחִיאֵל","transliteration":"yechiel","gloss":"Jehiel"},{"id":"H3172","lemma":"יְחִיאֵלִי","transliteration":"yechieli","gloss":"Jehieli"},{"id":"H3846","lemma":"לִבְנִי","transliteration":"livni","gloss":"Libnite"},{"id":"H3936","lemma":"לַעְדָּן","transliteration":"ladan","gloss":"Ladan"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}